ianmag.com/smart-news/art-sleuths-discovered-a-long-lost-and-enormously-important-portrait-of-an-elite-indian-woman-by-this-pioneering-scottish-painter-180989201/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能反驳了几十年前的数学思想，这是该技术迄今为止发挥作用的“最大猜想”</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ai-disproves-a-decades-old-mathematical-idea-the-biggest-conjecture-that-the-tech-has-played-a-role-in-yet-180989189/</link><description>一位数学家宣布，他使用 Anthropic 的一个人工智能模型找到了雅可比猜想问题的反例。虽然专家们认为这是一个里程碑，但这项工作提出了关于数学研究未来的问题</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 17:12:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ai-disproves-a-decades-old-mathematical-idea-the-biggest-conjecture-that-the-tech-has-played-a-role-in-yet-180989189/</guid></item><item><title>一项新研究表明，黑猩猩和倭黑猩猩会像人类一样，通过拥抱、亲吻和友好的轻拍来维持和平</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/chimpanzees-and-bonobos-use-hugs-kisses-and-pats-to-keep-the-peace-just-like-humans-a-new-study-suggests-180989192/</link><description>由于所有三种猿类都与生活在大约六百万至八百万年前的共同祖先分化，因此这些发现暗示，通过友好的接触来缓解紧张情绪具有深刻的进化起源。</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/chimpanzees-and-bonobos-use-hugs-kisses-and-pats-to-keep-the-peace-just-like-humans-a-new-study-suggests-180989192/</guid></item><item><title>三千年前，在语言“黄金时代”，人类可能比今天多说数千种语言</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/three-millennia-ago-humans-may-have-spoken-thousands-more-languages-than-we-have-today-during-a-linguistic-golden-age-180989197/</link><description>一项新研究表明，语言多样性在公元前 1000 年至公元 1000 年之间达到顶峰，然后下降</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 21:42:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/three-millennia-ago-humans-may-have-spoken-thousands-more-languages-than-we-have-today-during-a-linguistic-golden-age-180989197/</guid></item><item><title>欧洲人对欧元纸币新设计进行投票，这是自然与文化的对决，翠鸟与达芬奇之间的对立</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/its-nature-versus-culture-as-europeans-vote-on-new-designs-for-euro-banknotes-that-pit-kingfishers-against-leonardo-da-vinci-180989193/</link><description>欧洲央行公布了一系列新印制纸币的十种潜在设计的候选名单，这是自 2002 年欧元纸币发行以来的首次全面重新设计。</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 20:41:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/its-nature-versus-culture-as-europeans-vote-on-new-designs-for-euro-banknotes-that-pit-kingfishers-against-leonardo-da-vinci-180989193/</guid></item><item><title>这个机器人可以拍打翅膀来飞行和游泳。有一天它可能会帮助科学家研究潜水鸟类和调查海洋栖息地</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-robot-can-flap-its-wings-to-both-fly-and-swim-it-might-one-day-help-scientists-study-diving-birds-and-survey-ocean-habitats-180989172/</link><description>这款仿生装置重约半磅，宽约三英尺，也是仿照海雀、海鸥和潜鸟等水生鸟类设计的。</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 20:28:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-robot-can-flap-its-wings-to-both-fly-and-swim-it-might-one-day-help-scientists-study-diving-birds-and-survey-ocean-habitats-180989172/</guid></item><item><title>好莱坞标志性圆顶影院是世界上最著名的电影院之一，将于 2028 年初重新开放</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/hollywoods-iconic-cinerama-dome-one-of-the-worlds-most-famous-movie-theatres-is-set-to-reopen-in-early-2028-180989190/</link><description>自 Covid-19 大流行以来一直关闭的这座洛杉矶地标建筑，随着越来越多的美国人买票去电影院看电影而重新焕发活力</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 19:24:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/hollywoods-iconic-cinerama-dome-one-of-the-worlds-most-famous-movie-theatres-is-set-to-reopen-in-early-2028-180989190/</guid></item><item><title>这个巨大的天体是月球、行星还是介于两者之间的物体？这个奇怪的物体让天文标签受到质疑</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/is-this-giant-celestial-body-a-moon-a-planet-or-something-in-between-the-strange-object-calls-astrononomical-labels-into-question-180989183/</link><description>新发现的天体估计质量与木星大致相当，它绕着一颗褐矮星（一颗“失败的恒星”）运行，而褐矮星又绕着一颗小恒星运行。目前，研究人员将这个令人费解的天体称为“外卫星”</descriptio